--- !u!114 &114677555994056300
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1574311560775512}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 779
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 哎，我的灵石也不多，大多材料都是尽量自己猎杀妖兽或者在坊市购买，听说广陵城港口能买到海外金丹妖兽的材料，才想来碰碰运气，没想到这价格这么黑！
